Modifications (Apache-2.0 section 4(b)): every file listed as modified was changed from its source. Each
carries a header comment naming the source commit and path. The changes are:
(a) the module-name rewrite (voicerouter.X to zeo_core.voice.X, then zeo_core.voice.providers.X to
    zeo_integrations.voice.X; import statements only), ruff import order and line wrapping;
(b) the framework (rasa) engine classes and event types are replaced by the standalone types in
    zeo_core.voice.engine; the aiohttp session in _http_tts.py is replaced by httpx, a caller may inject
    the client; structlog is replaced by the standard-library shim _log.py;
(c) the API key is a constructor argument and is never read from the environment; the websockets and
    faster-whisper packages and numpy are imported when used and are not dependencies of this
    distribution, a missing one is reported as "not configured here";
(d) speechmatics.py carries only the ASR class (the upstream module also held a TTS class); the
    vendor CATALOGUE in providers/__init__.py is not carried;
(e) new in this repository: a configured endpoint must start with https:// (OpenAI text-to-speech) or
    wss:// (Speechmatics ASR), with its own test.

Names: "Rasa" appears only to identify provenance and compatibility. No endorsement by, or affiliation
with, the upstream owner is claimed.

Third-party: no third-party or vendored code was found in the copied files. audioop-lts (PSF-2.0) is a
dependency of zeocore 0.53.6 on Python 3.13 and later; it is not distributed here.

